# MASTER FRONTEND DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# BRIGHTLOOP SOFTWARE — SUBSCRIPTION MANAGEMENT SYSTEM

Act as a Senior React.js Developer, Enterprise SaaS UI/UX Designer, Frontend Architect and Product Designer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, modern, highly interactive Subscription Management System for Brightloop Software.

This is a real-world enterprise SaaS application, not a static dashboard template.

Build the complete frontend using React.js with professional UI design, functional navigation, interactive tables, dynamic forms, charts, filters, modals, notifications, role-based dashboards and customer self-service functionality.

The application must look and behave like a professionally developed commercial SaaS product.

IMPORTANT: Focus exclusively on the frontend. Do not generate Flask backend code, database schemas, SQL queries or backend business logic.

The frontend must be structured to integrate with an independently developed Python Flask REST API.

